Dorcan is one of the three founders of [[Org/Sedecium|Sedecium]] and is a god. He began as a mortal, a firbolg druid, and rose to godhood: when the Higher Kind Ruin of [[Geography/Ushas/index|Ushas]] was killed, he took up its mantle and became the new Ruin. When the Pale consumed the old landmasses of [[Geography/Ushas/index|Ushas]], he remade new landmasses out of it, and the people of Ushas live on that new ground.

Dorcan alone of his party distrusted the Patchwork Prince. He slipped into the Prince's home and found a book made of patchwork; the Prince caught him, cursed him with a mark, revealed himself as [[Divinity/Unknown Entities/Mephistopheles|Mephistopheles]], and let him go only on his promise of three great labours of Mephi's choosing, to be named some time in the future.
